  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low Carbon Development Initiative (LCDI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LCDI programme seeks to ensure the integration of an ambitious climate agenda into Indonesia&#x2019;s national development plan. The main focus of the LCDI programme is to reduce greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions whilst maintaining economic growth, reducing poverty, and meeting development targets. The LCDI programme works with Bappenas, relevant national ministries and provincial governments to achieve the following goals: &#xb7;       Building political support for low-carbon development within and outside of government; &#xb7;       Building knowledge and understanding of the LCDI approach among those responsible for implementing it within Government of Indonesia; &#xb7;       Supporting implementation of the LCDI approach, especially through provincial and national development plans; &#xb7;       Raising ambition to the highest levels set out in the LCDI report.</narrative>
  </description>
